摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"🌌 Mebular 忆云 · 智能体共享记忆与任务协作 | One shared memory and task graph for all your AI agents and devices: automatic or on-demand, secure, controllable, and decentralized!","id":"gh:1339704814","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"Mebular","slug":"Windsander/Mebular","topics":["agent-context","agent-memory","ai-memory","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","knowledge-graph","mcp","multi-agents","task-graph"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"🌌 Mebular 忆云 · 智能体共享记忆与任务协作 | One shared memory and task graph for all your AI agents and devices: a"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"utomatic or on-demand, secure, controllable, and decentralized!"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"**One memory. Every assistant. Every device.**"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A distributed memory network for your AI assistants."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Memory and tasks stay on your devices; devices sync directly."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"[](https://github.com/Windsander/Mebular/actions/workflows/ci.yml) [](LICENSE) [](docs/getting-start"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ed/QUICKSTART.md) [](docs/getting-started/QUICKSTART.md) [](https://awesome-dsh-plugin.com/p/Windsan"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"der/Mebular--packages-dsh-plugin/)"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Start in 5 minutes · How it works · Website · 中文"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"No hosted account · No central coordinator"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"The map at rest: devices and their shared-subscription edges. · On hover: task-domain lanes plus liv"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"e fleet traffic.\nBlue and gold show this device's two-way task-domain reachability, not peer-to-peer"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" traffic.\nBlue and gold show this device's two-way task-domain reachability, not peer-to-peer links."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## One memory"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"0.3 adds an optional runtime above MCP. Default off; local Qwen optional."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Memory Runtime guide · DSH · Hermes · OpenChamber"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Get started"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Desktop app · v0.3.2\nDownload & first launch"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Unsigned release\nmacOS Universal · Windows x64 · Linux x64\nDownload from GitHub Releases\nVerify with"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" SHA256SUMS.txt. macOS: right-click → Open. Windows: More info → Run anyway. Bundles Electron and it"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"S.txt. macOS: right-click → Open. Windows: More info → Run anyway. Bundles Electron and its runtime."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"**Or install the CLI and server:**"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Write with memory_write, hand off with task_submit — the same graph, from any assistant."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Docs"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Start\nLearn\nRun\nTrust"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Quickstart\nInstall & pair\nArchitecture\nNodes & sync\nConsole\nLocal GUI\nLimitations\nSensitive data"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Agent skills\nSetup playbooks\nFleet ops\nMulti-machine\nRelease SOP\nRelease steps\nSealing docs\nProtocol"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"skills\nSetup playbooks\nFleet ops\nMulti-machine\nRelease SOP\nRelease steps\nSealing docs\nProtocol rules"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Changelog · Roadmap\nReleased & planned\nContributing\nQuality gates\nSecurity\nReport a vuln\nWebsite\nPro"},{"id":"p23s2","text":" · Roadmap\nReleased & planned\nContributing\nQuality gates\nSecurity\nReport a vuln\nWebsite\nProduct site"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Use with DSH"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Install the plugin from npm into DSH's web profile:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"dsh plugin --profile web add @mebular/dsh-plugin@0.3.2"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"The App and the DSH Plugin are two equal entries to one local Mebular runtime: the plugin defaults t"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"o attach and connects to an existing App/CLI/service without starting or downloading anything. If no"},{"id":"p27s3","text":" runtime exists, the panel explicitly offers a pinned shared-runtime install. The sidebar panel embe"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"ds the same Console through ?embed=dsh (loopback only), and the official MCP client reaches the same"},{"id":"p27s5","text":" graph. The plugin is an independent adapter with its code isolated in packages/dsh-plugin; it is pu"},{"id":"p27s6","text":"blished by its own npm job, while its version follows the unified release train. For plugin developm"},{"id":"p27s7","text":"ent, install from packages/dsh-plugin instead."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Listed on awesome-dsh-plugin under memory."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"DSH plugin guide → · Integration notes →"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Who does what"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| Who | Handles |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| **You** | One-time pairing, Cloud choice, invites, subscriptions. |\n| **Your assistant** | Memory "},{"id":"p32s2","text":"reads and writes, task claim and completion. |\n| **Mebular** | Discovery, direct / relay / hole-punc"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"h, retries, certificates, service autostart. |"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Use it from code"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Runnable examples: `examples/quickstart` writes and recalls a preference; `examples/two-devices` dem"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"onstrates offline sync."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"v0.3.2 · early · MIT · © 2026 Sobert Li"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
